diff --git a/docs/release-notes.md b/docs/release-notes.md
index 3c4b743..3ce4f0b 100644
--- a/docs/release-notes.md
+++ b/docs/release-notes.md
@@ -2,6 +2,10 @@
 
 ## Latest Changes
 
+### Breaking Changes
+
+* Remove the `chain` parameter from `Typer()`, `Typer.callback()` and `Typer.add_typer()`. It was stored on `TyperInfo` and never passed to the group that would have used it, so setting it changed nothing: `app cmd1 cmd2` failed with `Got unexpected extra argument(s)` whatever its value. Passing `chain=` now raises `TypeError` instead of being accepted and ignored.
+
 ## 0.27.2 (2026-08-28)
 
 ### Refactors
